The GPL version 3 text is included in LICENSE. The imported code has been adapted to Forge 1.20.1 and the jemstones namespace.
Ruby currently has basic movement, combat and ownership with one fixed original
appearance. The Ruby Gem item summons an owned Ruby. Fusion, jobs and the
full gem lifecycle are not yet ported.
Textures are copied unchanged. Models, resource references and language keys
are adapted; Ruby, Pepo and Quartz limb pivots are adjusted for the new model API.
Ruby voice sounds are unavailable in the upstream checkout used for this port.

"Steven Universe" and all related characters and elements are trademarks of Cartoon Network.

Melon and Pumpkin use the original Pepo model, attributes and basic combat with spawn eggs.
Rose Quartz following is deferred. Upstream Pepo voice files are unavailable.
Pumpkin supports torch toggling, saved lighting and matching drops. Automatic
Halloween lighting is deferred.

Amethyst, Carnelian and Jasper include one fixed original quartz appearance each,
basic combat, ownership and gem-item summoning. Variants, equipment, jobs, fusion
and poof/reform remain deferred; upstream voice files are unavailable.

Giant Strawberry Slice retains its food values. The Glass of Time negates shared
day time and may toggle overworld weather, with a cancelable Forge event.
Modern weather timers use the 1.20.1 weather API. Neither item has a standalone
recipe in this source checkout; initial worldgen and structure acquisition remain deferred.

Giant Strawberry blocks include the original slice drops, Fortune cap, Silk Touch
and nine-slice crafting recipe. Natural generation remains deferred.
// Textures by Peridot#7455
Drained Gravel retains falling behaviour, stone-tier shovel harvesting and dust colour.

Strawberry seeds and stems adapt KAGIC's vanilla stem growth to the 1.20.1 stem
and attached-stem blocks, with original textures, foliage tint and slice-to-seed recipe.

Wavy Pink Sandstone Stairs retain the original textures and eight-stair recipe.
Active Gem Bases craft from nine active shards; both gem bases retain the original
16-item stack limit. Gem machinery and inactive-base crafting remain deferred.

Strawberry Head uses the original Pepo model, texture, attributes, egg colours and
3-7 strawberry-slice death drops. Rose Quartz following and natural spawning
remain deferred; upstream Pepo voice files are unavailable.

Transfer and Liberation Contracts retain original textures, recipes and signing.
Owner-signed contracts transfer or release the currently ported Ruby and Quartz gems.
Joint owners, faction servitude and contract voice responses remain deferred.
